    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Well, you know, we live in a magnificent society. And I think your audience understands and appreciates that America is unique in the world. not only currently, but unique in the history of the world. Very few nations have ever been like the United States of America. And that's because our nation, unlike a lot of others, was founded upon advancing the gospel of the kingdom. And that's what the pilgrims came to the United States to do. They came by faith. They were a missionary church plant to establish the gospel here and from here to take it across the world. That was also, there was about four different explorers, early, early explorers who came for that express purpose. And this nation was dedicated for that purpose. Now that that has been effectively abandoned by our nation's leaders, we're seeing the results that happened before our very eyes, we're seeing the United States of America melt away and become like just all the other nations of the earth, that the blessing The God's hand of blessing that was upon us were darts that were formed against us, seemed to ping off and bounce off. That was not because of us, but it was because of the protected shield of God over our nation. And now we're seeing that that is being lifted and we're feeling the ill effects from it. And so that's why I think as a prayer warrior and as many of the people in your audience are committed to prayer, That is our really only answer is to humble ourselves, repent of our sins, confess of our sins, and cry out to Holy God on behalf of our nation.",
