    "turn_text": "Amen. But you know, I'll tell you, I mean, since 2020, I've never seen more people, especially in this Christian community, that are more concerned, they're worried. We get letters every day of people that are really fearful what's happening in the country. And some people say, Pastor Todd, can this be turned around or at this point, are we at the point in no return? What say you on that?",
