    "turn_idx": 58,
    "turn_text": "He will go through the history of totalitarianism and socialism, communism, fascism. These are all fabulous speakers. I mean, they will hold you on the edge of your seat. And then after that four hours of laying the geopolitical situation in the world, we're going to hear from Dr. Ed Hindson. And Dr. Ed Heintson will dig into the Bible and give us the scriptures that show the parallel of the scripture to the parallel of the times that we're living in so that we will be prepared for this end time moment in history. to receive our Lord as He comes back. It's going to be powerful. You won't want to miss it. You can sign up at regent.edu forward slash globalism. You can watch it at regent.edu forward slash globalism. And when it's all said and done, it will be archived at regent.edu forward slash globalism. So I know there's a lot of watch parties down in Florida at the villages. There's already groups that are going to be watching it together. There's groups all over that are planning to watch it, but you can watch it on your phone. You can watch it in your home. Just pick it up. Regent.edu forward slash globalism. You'll be really happy that you watch this. We've done two before big conferences. One on election integrity that had millions and millions of minutes of views. Then we did another one on the 20 year anniversary of September 11th. 2001. And it was right after the collapse of Afghanistan. We had Secretary of State Mike Pompeo on and others. Those are both archived at region.edu. But this is not this one is fresh. And it addresses exactly what's happening right now. You can't get any more fresh than this. And no one else has done this that I know of. No one else has examined what's going on right now. So",
